<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen attacked a nurse responding to an Ebola alert in eastern DRC, killing her and wounding a health worker, while UN officials condemned the killing. A DRC legislator failed to persuade SADC to isolate President Kabila, and South African envoy urged inclusive dialogue. The conflict still produced 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5OMkE2ckFEdi04enBjZXVsekphLTVqVkRacVdKMzhuQ1RrNHByZjFOOEkxbEd5akFXUVdlV1hnWkRaN056RHRuRUtQYUIwYVk0Q1pqTFRuVUI5WXV3cEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxQdVlweC01SGUtVkRtbXY1NVJFdFcwYk8xbnBaSDY1ZW8zNExSN2lOWEh2RFFHemtlanp1a2NNNzNjM2Y0QlJGaFZqSV9GSnl6bDdJM244Qk95WHNvcl9Xc3o3b2FmOEZUb1VDamg2WTZBdW9vaWxZcGRVRjN1Nm5FQUN5c3hZc3A5T1J0UHdTTjVuTmxiOXUxUHZleWF4VmhFZ3ZxQzYzam5OX0k?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Premium Times Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQd3MzcV9qTlhoWUs5WTRiWUlxN1M2VnBiT2ZnZ2tUeER1TXJobDY2ai1SdW14dVhZTEF2TGFHcE9PUG11aFQ5dGdPY01nZ2ROT1d4SjFLNmt5LW1mZ29Ed3diYVM5bXlielBIdzJjNjNTeHo5Q1hQcW9jSnZwQ0dsODlZOWM2eU5aOTIxWVNGODkxbkhGS3BpUjlpenhTWG1rb1ZLY1RYbEpaVlREaVE1Y1Fn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Galaxy Television&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxQMWxsYWJXdUpPd0NHOENqMzk1ZmVxMThZRzVtR3QxUmJJT1VEQ1NweEdpTndOQUdIWUt0SFJyVHpLdVJ6aWNiN2JOdWswVEVaVzRxa2tmMXFuWDhXaVpSNGtXWXFPNV9hNU5HWHJHeXQzdUZBbDdDbGs0bVpkZVVLSTVUaVpFdUc2bmRuU3FybjJFYnJXS2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE5ncVlONUJucnp1TWJnYUNlN0VlLUcxc0hIZFJETEdVNExLeXdnSXJSV2V3bVBXU3hET084UHFWU